WEBVTT

00:00:06.238 --> 00:00:06.959
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:11.987
<v><b>F:</b></v> The little boy scampered effortlessly up the tree like a squirrel.

00:00:13.873 --> 00:00:14.596
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:15.616 --> 00:00:19.910
<v><b>M:</b></v> The car sped down the street and skidded when it reached the traffic lights.

00:00:21.207 --> 00:00:22.002
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:23.058 --> 00:00:27.226
<v><b>F:</b></v> She staggered down the steps and screamed when she felt herself falling.

00:00:29.175 --> 00:00:29.898
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:31.054 --> 00:00:35.601
<v><b>M:</b></v> The presenter strutted onto the stage and straightened his script as he spoke.

00:00:37.465 --> 00:00:38.336
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:39.358 --> 00:00:43.554
<v><b>F:</b></v> The man in the striped suit swaggered confidently through the store.